  "Description": "MCP4SH® ST Haptics v1.2 Preview - standard airframe profile.\r\n\r\nAn experimental flight-oriented ShakeIt profile bundled with MCP4SH v1.1.13.4 as a preview of the upcoming v1.2 aerospace track. The layout is organised around Flight Envelope, Airframe, and Powerplant & Systems.\r\n\r\nSeveral lanes intentionally reuse current MCP4SH outputs so the useful early DCS feel can be tested while native Powerplant and Airframe Load semantics are developed. Behaviour, naming and tuning may change before the final v1.2 release.",
